{#-
  Reminds somebody enrolled on a module that they have not yet finished
  an attempt at it. Sent on the schedule the module itself sets, and only
  the number of times it says. Context:
    name          who to greet: their full name, or their username where
                  the account has none
    module_title  the module they are enrolled on
    module_url    the link to the module in Quill
    is_last       true on the last reminder they will get
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}A reminder: {{ module_title }}{% endblock subject %}
{% block preheader %}You are enrolled and have not yet taken the assessment.{% endblock preheader %}
{% block body %}
{{ c.heading("Your module is *waiting*") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Hi " ~ name ~ ",") }}
{% call c.paragraph() %}You are enrolled on <strong>{{ module_title }}</strong> and have not yet completed an assessment attempt.{% endcall %}
{{ c.button("Open the module", module_url) }}
{% if is_last %}
{{ c.small("This is the last reminder we will send about this module.") }}
{% endif %}
{% endblock body %}
{% block reason %}You are receiving this because you are enrolled on this module in Quill.{% endblock reason %}

{% block text %}
Hi {{ name }},

You are enrolled on {{ module_title }} and have not yet completed an assessment attempt.

Open the module: {{ module_url }}
{% if is_last %}

This is the last reminder we will send about this module.
{% endif %}
{% endblock text %}
